   ],
   "red_not_run": "The Kotlin vectors test is green on the base and on the tip: the base codec already refuses a nested member value, so the four new rows only add data it already satisfies. The red check for the change is the Python oracle tier, which CI runs: on the unchanged oracle the four rows answer type instead of syntax and a body nested twice the recursion limit raises RecursionError (measured at the gate: 326 tests before, 328 after, both new tests red on the base)."
  }
